<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Tawa Teigwa Yoba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tawa Teigwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tawa Teigwa Yoba</para>
  <para style="mt">Tawa Teigwa Yoba</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Israel yoba tawa siragl mere tenaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sin offering" file="C036 bw OT.tif" size="span" copy="Ethnos360" ref="1.1">Ye ogono sisip bre mina padiglko, agl bugla againo yugo, Yawe tadaglmeno si bi di togwa</figure>Ana Yawe ye Israel yoba ye sel yugumo keimara i yugugl mogl, Moses agle dugo, ugwa. Moses ugo, Yawe ye di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />Ene Israel yoba di te, yegl dinatniwa, Ene we, ene Yawe tawa tenatnga igne i ene sipsip mo meme mo kau ta idre, tawa tenatnga. <verse eid="LEV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Ana ene tawa mudu gagl tenatnga i pre kau ta idre, tenatnga panan, kau kumugl wakai ta morabuka inatnga. Ogo gagie wagle num dekre, kide ta paikrabuka i, inatniwa. Idre, ede pi Yawe ene wakai kanabedi sel yugumo dua wagle edinatniwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Edidre, ogon agl bugla bre mina padratniwa. Padigln, agl bugla i ene againen inan, Yawe ene tadaglmenen si bi di tenabuka. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Ene yegl ersre, Yawe gumuglo wagle kau i si gotn, Aron wama, tawa teigwa yagle meglkwa i, ye bormai kogl i pi tawa gagl naraiglmara bogl i koglo koglo bage 4-pela si plai si edinaiglmiwa. Bogl ta tawa gagl naraiglmara sel yugu dua yomara magigl yogwa i pre die dugwa.<verse eid="LEV 1:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Aron mawagl podo pamara yoko gua ta pikrabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Moses yegl di togwa, Na ka ta ene di tebo, ene agitn Aron di tenatnga. Ka i yegl mere paugwa, Aron yene unagledi prabuka igne ede u kiule mawagl podo pamara, lap podo kogl kegl dimara kigle kra i, ta ukrabuka. Boks yogo, boks pre na yoba tadaglmeno si bi dinaglmara yomara i yene prabere ta ukrabuka pre diga. Ye ta unan, gorabuka. Na boks pre yomara mitna i kamun kua mina atne moglka pre yene prabere udre, na kanan, na ye si goraglka. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Ba ye unabuka panan, ege i, ye tawa suo narsre, unabuka. Ta, kau kumugl ta bugla yugu mere ta moglkrabuka yene tadaglmemo pre si gogl narsre, te, ta meme kumugl ta si gogl, mudu gagl tege ere narabuka. Taragl suo i narsre, ede kiule i unabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LEV 16:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Taragl mudu bormai mina kor meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Taragl mudu bormai mina kor meglkwa. Yegl pre na ene tadaglmeno si bi dinaglka i, tawa teigwa yagle bormai kogl i pi tawa naraiglmara bogl i mina si plai si edinaiglmedi di teiga. Taragl mudu bormai mina kor meglkwa i pre bormai swara i mina na ene tadeglmeno si bi dinaluwe di, God yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LEV 17:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
</usx>